{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"36a068f719d603dab52ec9bd1a7bf165815d20bd5e4f7e1e1b66ed2c93f6bd8b","ja":"朋花のために","zh":"为了朋花","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b63bbf216e5e7b96f0d15429acc0710b0a4bb81431d0be2479b07f146406fb89","ja":"……ってことがあったの！\nあの時の朋花ちゃん、とっても可愛かったよ♪","zh":"……事情就是这样！\n那个时候的朋花，真的特别可爱哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"85837df900174df6fde7843abb3cf776e9808336bd83e244dc9873076b4235a9","ja":"あら、茜ちゃんも？\n私も昨日、朋花ちゃんに頼られたの。","zh":"哎呀，小茜也是吗？\n我昨天也被朋花拜托了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e993fc71ae074e6b5759d08fd6534309561850f2b5d0f09a4b890f29b71699e8","ja":"みなさんもですか？　最近の朋花さん、\nなんだか甘えんぼさんになったみたいですね？","zh":"大家也是这么觉得的吗？最近朋花她，\n总觉得变得有些爱撒娇了呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e94862866434c8a7b18e26d6aec9b01ba27f07cfa076463f40de62473f90c261","ja":"うんうん！　隣にぴたってくっついてきて、\n子猫みたいな感じ？","zh":"嗯嗯！紧紧贴在旁边，\n感觉就像小猫咪一样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6b8995b6371cde1f64c139a3f03b2b7d891deab05e9e0d375b87a1a8ec0a5704","ja":"……もしかして朋花ちゃん、\nこの前の星梨花ちゃんと同じ状況なんじゃないかしら？","zh":"……难道朋花，\n遇到了和之前星梨花一样的状况吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3629400844711092ae7a325a3c4d09eeb8038a9066080c4825cb9e283c5b16d1","ja":"ほら、星梨花ちゃん、自分が演じた役に入り込んで\n影響を受けちゃってたでしょ。","zh":"你看，星梨花不是入戏太深，\n受到角色影响了嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"15021dfae95be1c9ebc64bc67ce983ed47992d2f591768e996a78040154acd99","ja":"でも朋花ちゃんの役って、藍ちゃんでしょ？\nぜんぜん違うよね？","zh":"不过朋花演的角色，是小蓝吧？\n完全不一样呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"523a32d9424c7cb40425fe162ddfe6bb9118338718a5443673d108de7d1e81f7","ja":"ええ。朋花ちゃんの場合は\n影響が逆に出てるって言うか……。","zh":"嗯。朋花的情况\n可以说是影响起到了反效果……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cc1903ac0ef9f4d934e7d68f01e66d3ab1f00c947f5b481e9920a1499d1a6c3d","ja":"みんなに強く当たる役だったから、\nその反動で甘えたくなってるんじゃないかしら？","zh":"因为演的是对大家态度很严厉的角色，\n是不是受其反作用影响，所以想撒撒娇了呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7718987c945bef52f3b4c2d15fb88ce07821c6f4aa62df487ff74fdd273febf0","ja":"なるほど……！　朋花さん、優しいですから、\nああいう役はつらかったんですね……。","zh":"原来如此……！朋花很温柔，\n演那种角色肯定很难受吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8b78c77e84917e84262d709615c4cc8a51fd1cc1e646c53c00f5d21fc5779c50","ja":"それなら、優しい優しい茜ちゃんが、\nもっとも～っと、朋花ちゃんを甘えさせちゃわなきゃ！","zh":"既然这样，那温柔体贴的小茜，\n可得让朋花更加、更加尽情撒娇才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c314fa9c73af6756b44c37093535771fb87c45006b7d74317a30fe39b7e5ff93","ja":"そうね。みんなで朋花ちゃんの事、\n癒やしてあげましょう！","zh":"是啊。我们大家一起来\n好好治愈朋花吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e7d16733f9b06f71c08d32dd2be12865cb051514f306afd28064e6258b919af9","ja":"もしもし、●●●●プロデューサーさんですか～？\n例のドッキリ企画、うまくいってますよ～。","zh":"喂～，是●●●●制作人吗～？\n之前说的那个整蛊企划，进展得很顺利哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"d0557cbc919cf7e59ddf58d7a65df3221fd213a5f7b0bd9eb12e121c839e3e53","ja":"はい、いつもと違う姿を見せて、\nまわりがどんな反応をするか、という……。","zh":"是的，想展现和平时不一样的身姿，\n看看周围会有什么反应……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"206a05cffb2ee82b210bcc7a02ce021c8a737c67fa86bae92e41b6b4ed4cf5df","ja":"ですが、うまくいきすぎて、なんだかみなさんに\n気を遣わせてしまっているようでして～……。","zh":"但是，由于进展得太顺利了，总觉得反倒\n让大家有些顾虑了呢～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"35bb7127b861cce551fe171674e4867e9be1dfdffcdcf5851fad6986d7e34e5d","ja":"プロデューサーとして、みなさんへの\nフォローはしっかりお願いしますからね～！","zh":"作为制作人，请一定要好好\n关照大家哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
